TEXT 776 1376 Left 2 ;This is a crude way to close the loop in dc\n(and have LTspice compute the right control voltage)\nwhile opening it in ac via LoL/CoL.\n \nFor a reason I need to dig, the circuit does not converge\nwell in ac and I had to tweak the CoL/LoL network.
TEXT 1336 400 Left 2 !*\n.param L=50u ; inductance value\n.param Vin=10 ; input voltage\n.param Vout=15 ; output voltage\n.param Fsw=300k ; switching frequency\n.param Vp=2 ; this is the sawtooth peak voltage\n*
